{
  "label": "tsuneyofirsthall",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label tsuneyofirsthall:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey Tsuneyo. What are you doing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 嘿，Tsuneyo。你在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No response.",
      "zh": "没有回应。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Is she looking at the board or something?",
      "zh": "她是在看布告栏还是什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": "I glance over Tsuneyo’s shoulder to see if there’s a flyer for...noodles or something, but everything up there seems to be normal.",
      "zh": "我越过 Tsuneyo 的肩膀瞥了一眼，想看看上面有没有……面条之类的传单，可上面的一切似乎都很正常。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello? Earth to Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 喂？地球呼叫 Tsuneyo。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you ever just...think about whales?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 你有没有……就是……想过鲸鱼？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not really, no.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 不太有，没有。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall2.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you know that the life expectancy of the blue whale is anywhere from 80-90 years?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 你知道蓝鲸的寿命大约在 80 到 90 年之间吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Though, there are some cases in which whales have lived for much longer.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 不过，也有一些鲸鱼活得更久的案例。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you for this information that I will likely never use again.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 谢谢你提供这条我大概永远不会再用的信息。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re welcome.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 不客气。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...what are you up to tonight?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 那么……你今晚打算做什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thinking about whales.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 想鲸鱼。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see that. What {i}else{/i} are you up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我看出来了。{i}除此之外{/i}你还打算做什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Talking about whales?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 聊鲸鱼？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What I’m asking is if you have any plans.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我想问的是你有没有什么计划。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t have anything to do, so I wanted to see if you’d be down to hang out for a bit.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我没别的事，所以想看看你愿不愿意出来混一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In the hallway?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 在走廊里？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": It doesn’t have to be the hallway. We could go to your room if you’d like.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 不一定要在走廊。你想的话我们可以去你房间。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I’d prefer the hallway.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 我觉得我更想在走廊。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Being alone in a room with a boy is something I’m supposed to avoid.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 和一个男生单独待在房间里，是我应该避免的事。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if tsuneyodorm5 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’ve been in your room before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 可我以前去过你房间啊。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, because it would have been rude for me to deny you entry.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 是的，因为拒绝你进门会很失礼。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right now, we are already in the hallway. So I just won’t go back in my room.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 现在我们已经站在走廊里了。所以我就不回房间了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can talk out here.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 我们可以在这儿聊。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, so I’ll never be allowed in?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 等等，所以你永远不会让我进去？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You probably will.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 大概会的。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I tend to cave under pressure.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 我一向扛不住压力。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's whatever. I'm fine with talking in the hallway, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 随你吧。我想在走廊聊也行。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just prefer a topic slightly more interesting than the amount of time whales live.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我只是想要一个比鲸鱼活多久稍微有意思一点的话题。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can probably manage that.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 这个我大概做得到。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Have you met Noodles?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 你见过 Noodles 吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": We literally named him together, Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我们俩可是亲手给他起的名字，Tsuneyo。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 啊——"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m surprised he’s still up there. How does a bird even get into the dorms?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我很惊讶他还在上面。一只鸟到底是怎么进宿舍的？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Perhaps he is enrolled at the[school]?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 也许他已经注册进了[school]？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": How would a bird even enroll?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 一只鸟到底要怎么注册？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s crazy what you can do with a computer nowadays.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 如今用一台电脑能干出多疯狂的事都有可能。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He literally does not have hands. He can’t type.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 他根本没有手。他没法打字。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, he doesn’t know how to read either. This entire topic is flawed.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 等等，他也不识字。这整个话题都站不住脚。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I had no idea you hated birds so much.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 我不知道你这么讨厌鸟。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What did Noodles ever do to you?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": Noodles 到底对你做过什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t hate birds. I just don’t think-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我不讨厌鸟。我只是不觉得——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": You just don’t think they should be allowed to attend[school] like the rest of us.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 你只是觉得它们不该像我们其他人一样上[school]。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, that’s-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 不，那是——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Actually. Yes, that’s right.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 其实。对，就是这么回事。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles, attack.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": Noodles，攻击。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw!",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 呱！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, he actually makes noise.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 哦，他真的会出声。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not all he can do.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 那不是他唯一会做的事。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is that supposed to-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 这话是什么——"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw!",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 呱！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the fuck?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 什么鬼？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where did it get such a small knife?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 它从哪儿弄来这么小一把刀的？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do not ask questions you are afraid to hear the answers to.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 别问你害怕听到答案的问题。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You gave the bird a knife, didn’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 是你给了那只鸟一把刀，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": Tsuneyo。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I couldn’t just say no to him.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 那个，我总不能对他说不吧。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": He {i}asked{/i} you for one?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 他跟你{i}要{/i}的？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought maybe he wanted to learn how to prepare dinner for his family.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 我想他也许是想学着给家人做顿晚饭。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": He doesn’t have a family, though. He would have gone back to them already.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 可他没有家人啊。要有的话他早回去了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Perhaps he is just a horrible parent?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 也许他只是个糟糕的家长？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": If birds are able to attend[school], it is also possible that they, too, struggle with certain family values from time to time.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 如果鸟能上[school]，那它们偶尔也在某些家庭观念上挣扎，也是有可能的。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": They...can’t attend[school], though. How did we get back to this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 它们……不能上[school]啊。我们怎么又绕回这个了？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles, attack.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": Noodles，攻击。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw!",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 呱！"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodles, don’t attack.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": Noodles，别攻击。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": ..."
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why does he only respond to you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 为什么他只听你的？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He is thankful that I provided him the tools he needs to prepare dinner for his family.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 他很感激我给了他给家人准备晚饭所需的工具。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re going to go with that dinner excuse, you’re going to need to tell him to stop attacking me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 你要是打算一直拿晚饭当借口，那你得叫他别再攻击我了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t force Noodles into a life of murder.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 别把 Noodles 逼上一条杀人的路。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What is my life becoming?",
      "zh": "我的人生到底变成什么了？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why am I arguing with a [teenage]girl about birds when there are several others I can think of off the top of my head that would have sex with me?",
      "zh": "我为什么要在走廊上跟一个 [teenage] 女孩争论鸟的事，而我随口一想就能想到好几个愿意和我上床的女孩？"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyohall10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyohall10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyohall10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw! {i}(Perhaps it’s because you’ve become too complacent with your current life and are just looking for that “chase” once again.)",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 呱！{i}（也许是因为你对现在的生活太过安于现状，只是在重新寻找那种「追逐」的感觉。）{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caw! Caw! {i}(Or perhaps you find comfort in knowing that there is someone with a fresh view of not only you, but of everything.)",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 呱！呱！{i}（又或者，你在这样一个人身上找到了安慰——她不仅对你，而是对一切都还抱着新鲜的眼光。）{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Caaaaw! {i}(A worldview untainted by the evils of man. Just a girl with a passion for her craft and not a care in the world about romance.)",
      "spk": "Noodles",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 呱——啊！{i}（一种未被人类之恶污染的世界观。只是一个对自己的手艺充满热情、对恋爱毫无所谓女孩。）{/i}"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
