    {
      "en": ": Okay, I think it might be time for me to leave.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 好吧，我觉得我该走了。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Already? Why?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 已经走了？为什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m beginning to think the bird is talking to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我开始觉得那只鸟在跟我说话。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": But he is talking to you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 可他确实在跟你说话啊。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I taught Noodles about existentialism.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 我教了 Noodles 存在主义。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...How?",
