      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 当然，随便。什么问题？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s kind of personal, so I apologize if this crosses any lines.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ": 这问题有点私人，所以如果越界了我先道歉。"
